## 8️⃣ TL;DR code snippets

### 8.1 Custom vector tiles (plain fetch)

```js
maplibregl.addProtocol('mytiles', (params, abort) => {
  const url = params.url
    .replace('{z}', params.z)
    .replace('{x}', params.x)
    .replace('{y}', params.y);
  return fetch(url, { signal: abort })
    .then(r => r.arrayBuffer())
    .then(buf => ({
      data: buf,
      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/x-protobuf' }
    }));
});
```

### 8.2 PMTiles (no changes needed)

```js
import * as pmtiles from 'pmtiles';
const pm = new pmtiles.Protocol();
maplibregl.addProtocol('pmtiles', pm.tile); // works in v4
```

### 8.3 Raster tiles (PNG)

```js
maplibregl.addProtocol('raster', (params, abort) => {
  const url = params.url
    .replace('{z}', params.z)
    .replace('{x}', params.x)
    .replace('{y}', params.y);
  return fetch(url, { signal: abort })
    .then(r => r.arrayBuffer())
    .then(buf => ({
      data: buf,
      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'image/png' }
    }));
});
```

### 8.4 Glyphs (optional)

```js
maplibregl.addProtocol('glyphs', (params, abort) => {
  const url = params.url; // already contains {fontstack}/{range}.pbf
  return fetch(url, { signal: abort })
    .then(r => r.arrayBuffer())
    .then(buf => ({
      data: buf,
      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/x-protobuf' }
    }));
});
```

